# Copy to .env. No API keys needed: the data is in data/, and Gemini runs on Vertex AI with your
# gcloud credentials (gcloud auth application-default login).

# The Google Cloud project that Vertex AI bills for every model call. Set it, so runs don't silently
# bill whatever project `gcloud config set project` last pointed at. It needs Vertex AI enabled.
# On Cloud Run, set it as an environment variable of the service instead.
VERTEXAI_PROJECT=your-gcp-project-id
